<html>
  <head>
    <style>
      .header {
        background-color: navy;
        color: white;
        padding: 20px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      
      .header h1 {
        font-size: 36px;
        margin-top: 0;
      }
      
      .content {
        background-color: #f2f2f2;
        padding: 40px;
      }
      
      .content h2 {
        font-size: 24px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }
      
      .content p {
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.5;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }
      
      .footer {
        background-color: navy;
        color: white;
        padding: 20px;
        text-align: center;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Giftcard Submission Acknowledgement</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <h2>Dear {{fullname}},</h2>
      <p>We wanted to take a moment to acknowledge the trade of your giftcard's submission. We appreciate your time and we are committed to processing your request as efficiently as possible.</p>
      <p>Kindly use our mobile app to track and to keep you informed of its status. If you have any questions in the meantime, please don't hesitate to reach out to us.</p>
      <p>Thank you for choosing our platform for your trade needs.</p>
      <p>Best regards,</p>
      <p>{{product_name}}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>Copyright © 2023 {{company_name}}. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
